            "id": "9495e90b-a69c-5eaf-a472-b6b536856f28"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " or a similar effect; the affliction can then be removed as a normal disease. A creature that dies from cold damage while cursed with blackfrost rises as a blackfrost dead after 24 hours. Blackfrost has a counteract rank of 10."
